    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/w32zBs17aWbX1Fh7yxKEdyjo_urT3caim1U537y4JxQ.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\r\nLet circle be $\\left(x-x_{1}\\right)=r \\cos \\theta$\r\n$y-y_{1}=r \\sin \\theta$\r\n$h=\\frac{a+x_{1}+r \\cos \\theta}{2}$\r\n$k=\\frac{b+y_{1}+r \\sin \\theta}{2}$\r\n$\\Rightarrow\\left(h-\\frac{\\left(a+x_{1}\\right)}{2}\\right)^{2}+\\left(k-\\frac{\\left(b+y_{1}\\right)}{2}\\right)^{2}=\\frac{r^{2}}{4}$",
